ry/Utility rm. The other end of this home are 2 large Jr. bedrms & 4 pc bath. Outside is the Oversized deck with power awning, mostly fenced, landscaped yard. the Oversized single detached garage completes this home. This affordable property is ready for a new family! Come take a look, you won’t be disappointed! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$339,900"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,367 sq ft"],["Year built","2020"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Morinville"],["Town","Morinville"],["Postal code","T8R2P7"],["MLS® number","E4516075"],["Listed","November 10, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Window Coverings, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Parking","Detached Garage, Oversize"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.72 m × 3.92 m (18'9\" × 12'10\")"],["Dining room","Main level","2.17 m × 4.45 m (7'1\" × 14'7\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.55 m × 4.45 m (11'8\" × 14'7\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","4.09 m × 5.20 m (13'5\" × 17'1\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","2.81 m × 3.45 m (9'3\" × 11'4\")"],["Bedroom 3","Main level","2.79 m × 3.45 m (9'2\" × 11'4\")"]],"courtesy":"Linda Getzlaf, RE/MAX Real Estate","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"morinville","hood_slug":"","area":""}